    docs/automation/pending/README.md
                         THREE things, and each is named here by the words it
                         actually opens with, because the last two rounds got
                         this wrong by describing them instead:
                           - this patch's row in "Waiting now". The row is the
                             worked example :31-33 gives for the very rule this
                             block quotes, and a row for a file that is gone
